    "title": "Esmeralda Torres Game Report: @ North Salinas - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n16 hours ago Esmeralda Torres was a major factor in Marina's victory over North Salinas on Tuesday. Torres was dynamite, rushing for 116 yards and one TD on only nine carries, while also throwing for 51 yards and one touchdown. She also put in work on the defensive side of the ball, picking up a sack and making one tackle. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
